@startuml AI Alarm Creator – Sequence Diagram
title AI Alarm Creator · Key Sequences

skinparam defaultFontName Roboto
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam backgroundColor #FAFCFA
skinparam sequenceArrowColor #37474F
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #2E7D32

actor User
participant "AIPromptDialog" as UI
participant "AIViewModel" as VM
participant "GenerativeModel\n(Gemini SDK)" as Gemini
participant "Moshi" as Moshi
participant "SetupScreen" as Setup

== Generate Alarm via AI Prompt ==

User -> UI : tap AI sparkle from Home
UI -> UI : show dialog

User -> UI : type prompt\n"Alarm when sunny and > 70°F"
User -> UI : tap Submit

UI -> VM : generateAlarm(prompt)
activate VM

VM -> VM : emit AIUiState(isLoading=true)
VM --> UI : loading spinner shown

VM -> Gemini : generateContent(\n  systemPrompt + userPrompt\n)
activate Gemini
note right : Prompt includes JSON schema\nso Gemini returns parseable output
Gemini --> VM : GenerateContentResponse
deactivate Gemini

VM -> VM : response.text → raw JSON
VM -> Moshi : adapter(AlarmDraft).fromJson(json)
activate Moshi
Moshi --> VM : AlarmDraft
deactivate Moshi

VM -> VM : emit AIUiState(draft=draft)
deactivate VM

VM -> Setup : navigate with AlarmDraft\n(Moshi-serialized nav arg)
note right : User reviews and can\nmodify before saving

== Error Handling ==

VM -> Gemini : generateContent(prompt)
activate Gemini
Gemini --> VM : exception / unparseable text
deactivate Gemini

VM -> VM : runCatching → Result.Failure
VM -> VM : emit AIUiState(\n  error="Unable to generate alarm"\n)
VM --> UI : show error message
User -> UI : modify prompt & retry

@enduml
